  m_Name: Planet3_dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodes:
  - npcText: "Hello there stranger. Hit 'ENTER' to reply. \n"
    options:
    - text: Oh. Hello.
      nextNode: 1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: So you are the chosen one.
    options:
    - text: Me?
      nextNode: 2
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: You were chosen to destroy asteroids. You decide little, but sometimes
      you can choose a reply using ARROW UP, ARROW DOWN, W, or D.
    options:
    - text: Do all
      nextNode: 3
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: SPAWN_TUTORIAL_ASTEROIDS
    - text: my choices
      nextNode: 3
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: SPAWN_TUTORIAL_ASTEROIDS
    - text: mean something?
      nextNode: 3
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: SPAWN_TUTORIAL_ASTEROIDS
  - npcText: "Some do, some don\u2019t, but what matters most blasting asteroids
      in asteroid areas. Like the one that just spawned behind your back. "
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 4
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: let me just test win condition
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: TEST_VIC
  - npcText: Fly into the area. Move with WASD or ARROW KEYS, shoot with SPACE, avoid
      asteroids, and earn points by destroying them.
    options:
    - text: And if asteroid hits me?
      nextNode: 5
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: You lose a life, and if you lose them all, you die.
    options:
    - text: Oh... that's it? No replay or anything?
      nextNode: 6
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: No. This is not a video game, but there is a trick.
    options:
    - text: Tell me.
      nextNode: 7
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: In asteroid areas you can bail out. Press 'E' and after seven seconds
      you return to safety. You do not have to die there.
    options:
    - text: So what should I do now?
      nextNode: 8
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Fly into the area behind you and destroy asteroids. Reach 800 points,
      press 'E' to eject, then return and we will talk again.
    options:
    - text: Ok, I will try.
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 1
      newPlanetNode: 9
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Got 800 points already?
    options:
    - text: Yes
      nextNode: 10
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: CHECKPOINTS800
    - text: No
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'No you don''t. Go get the points. '
    options:
    - text: Sure.
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: CHECKPOINTS800
  - npcText: Good. Now it is time to reveal a secret.
    options:
    - text: Huh?
      nextNode: 12
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: REMOVE_TUTORIAL_ASTEROIDS
  - npcText: There are other planets. Fly close enough and you will be pulled into
      their orbit to talk or trade.
    options:
    - text: Anything else?
      nextNode: 13
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: TUTORIAL_PASSED
  - npcText: 'Some planets do not speak your language, so you may need a ship with
      a translator. There is a planet upwards from here that speaks your language. '
    options:
    - text: And my next goal is?
      nextNode: 14
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: "Explore space, go upward.I do not know. If you want a dorky win condition
      \u2013\_reach 100,000 points and come back. And do not return with questions
      \u2013\_I do not speak your language."
    options:
    - text: "What do you mean? You\u2019re speaking it right now."
      nextNode: 15
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: "That\u2019s the catch. I only know the phrases that I have told before
      this. Good luck. Bye."
    options:
    - text: Uhm... ok, bye then.
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 1
      newPlanetNode: 17
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: 'You are kidding, right? '
      nextNode: 17
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: "\xD6\xF6 \xE4\xE4\xE4\xFC\xF6\xE4\xF6? 100,000 \xF5\xE4\xE4\xFC\xF6\xF6"
    options:
    - text: 'Okay, got it. Have a nice day then. '
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 18
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: "\xE4\xF5\xF6 100,000 \xF6\xF6\xE4\xF5\xF6\xFC? "
    options:
    - text: 'Yeah, here are your points. '
      nextNode: 18
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: CHECKPOINTS10000
    - text: Uhm... no, not yet...
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: CHECKPOINTS10000
  - npcText: "\xF5. 100,000"
    options:
    - text: Mkay, you are right...
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 1
      newPlanetNode: 17
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'You did. You truly are the chosen one. '
    options:
    - text: PLACEHOLDER FOR WINCOND
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
